          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-white">The WalkingPad A1 Pro is still on sale from WalkingPad and still a sound
            fold-in-half walking pad</strong>, with a 47 by 16.5-inch deck, a 300 lb version and a folded length
